<title>USA: MCA changes name to Universal Studios.</title>
<headline>MCA changes name to Universal Studios.</headline>
<dateline>UNIVERSAL CITY, Calif. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCA Inc Monday said it changed its name to Universal Studios Inc.</p>
<p>Universal, which is 80 percent owned by Seagram Co Ltd, has a variety of entertainment operations, including motion pictures, television, music, home entertainment and location based entertainment.</p>
</text>
